            <title>[IGNITE-11215] MVCC: JVM crash in MVCC PDS 1 suite</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11215</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes JVM crash &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccPds1&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeHistoryList&amp;amp;state=failed&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;occurs&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;tt&gt;vacuum-cleaner&lt;/tt&gt; thread in&#160;&lt;tt&gt;ExplicitWalDeltaConsistencyTest&lt;/tt&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;
