                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16785744" author="amashenkov" created="Wed, 6 Mar 2019 15:29:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Seems, Vacuum should run cleanup() method inside busyLock section to prevent a race b\w cache stop\destroy.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve made a PR and trigger mass test on TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16791696" author="amashenkov" created="Wed, 13 Mar 2019 13:36:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve fixed few potential races in mvcc Vacuum.&lt;br/&gt;
The root of the issue is PageMemoryTracker (it is&#160;used in test to verify WAL) stopped too early.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16792710" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 14 Mar 2019 14:27:11 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: Possible Blockers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;Cache 5&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3312215]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheTestSuite5: IgniteCachePartitionLossPolicySelfTest.testReadWriteSafeWithBackupsAfterKillThreeNodes&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;TRANSACTIONAL&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; - 0,0% fails in last 15 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3304597&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16792717" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 14 Mar 2019 14:31:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Mass ExplicitWalDeltaConsistencyTest run look ok.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failed&#160;most likely is related to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13711&quot; title=&quot;Exception is discarded in GridCacheProcessor&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-13711&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-13711&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16793534" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 15 Mar 2019 10:49:36 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3312263&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
